# Git index is user-owned

The user always stages and commits. Never touch the index. Never create commits.

## NEVER

* `git add`, `git commit`, `git commit --amend`
* `git rm` / `git mv` when that writes the index
* Staging or committing via any other tool
* "Helpful" staging to keep a changeset coherent

Leave working-tree edits unstaged. The user runs `git add` / `git commit` themselves.
